    source_en: "G. Pettinato, The Archives of Ebla (1981). A. Archi, \"The Epigraphic Evidence from Ebla and the Old Testament\", Biblica 60 (1979). H. La Fay, \"Ebla: Splendor of an Unknown Empire\", National Geographic, December 1978.",
